ningsPerShareBasicAndDilutedTableTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_d670c479-733e-45b9-be2f-b8e4511e886d_1"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The components of basic and diluted loss per NCM, Inc. share are as follows:</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:continuation id="F_d670c479-733e-45b9-be2f-b8e4511e886d_1"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p>
